After getting a little tired of NetHack I thought I'd have a look at the
much-raved-about Angband. Nethack is much, much better. To be quite honest
I think Angband is a total waste of time. Random dungeons - pah!

The one thing good about Angband is that the artifacts 'activate'. Now I 
know some of you will say "But the nethack artifacts activate too". They 
don't. Nethack artifacts like Stormbringer might say The black blade drains
the life from the <insert creature name here> but to be quite honest
it'd be much better if once in a while stormbringer activated for a death 
ray as well. Or Fire brand activated for a fire ball.

Mjollnir - Bolt of lightning
Stormbringer - Death ray
Magic Bane - Magic Missile
Fire Brand - Fireball
Frost Brand - Cone of cold
Sting/Orcrist - Activates to scare orcs, and goblins.
Grayswandir - Activates to scare undead such as zombies, vampires, vamp. bats.
Sunsword - Activates to bless inventory item.

Thats about all of the most useful ones for each character class.
Might be good to put something like it in a new version....

